### UStudent API - Prerequisites & Eligibility Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Check CS101 Eligibility for Student 1 (no prerequisites)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/eligibility?studentId=1

### Check CS101 Eligibility for Student 2 (no prerequisites)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/eligibility?studentId=2

### Check CS201 Eligibility for Student 1 (requires CS101 + Sophomore + 30 credits)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/eligibility?studentId=1

### Check CS201 Eligibility for Student 2 (should fail multiple requirements)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/eligibility?studentId=2

### Check MATH201 Eligibility for Student 1 (requires MATH101 + 2.5 GPA)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/4/eligibility?studentId=1

### Check MATH201 Eligibility for Student 2 (requires MATH101 + 2.5 GPA)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/4/eligibility?studentId=2

### Check ENG101 Eligibility for Student 1 (no special requirements)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/5/eligibility?studentId=1

### Check ENG101 Eligibility for Student 2 (no special requirements)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/5/eligibility?studentId=2

### Get Eligible Courses for Student 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/eligible-courses

### Get Eligible Courses for Student 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/eligible-courses